  "limitations": [
    "This batch covers deterministic SGDOneClassSVM._fit_one_class and _partial_fit shell behavior: artificial targets, validation masks, fixed one-class solver context, offset/intercept conversion, t_ advancement, averaging threshold and buffers, parameter allocation payloads, delegated _fit_one_class payloads, and _partial_fit return identity.",
    "Compiled _plain_sgd execution, stochastic updates, convergence, dataset construction, random seed generation, penalty and learning-rate type lookup, and validation-score callbacks are outside this batch.",
    "Generic SGD learning-rate formulas, l1_ratio normalization, passive-aggressive helpers, classifier fit callbacks, regressor fit callbacks, and SGD tags remain owned by existing sklearn.linear_model.sgd and SGD shell families."
  ],
